 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Previously, Arkady and young Lyosha had fun playing war games in the communal corridor. Meanwhile, at Ivan Samsonov's flat, Ivan returns home after three days away and asks his family to support him at the upcoming televised mayoral debate.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Привет, семья! Я вернулся домой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Ох, живой! Надо же!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Тебя три дня дома не было!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Я ночами совсем не спала.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я просто взял короткую паузу.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Завтра вечером у меня дебаты.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Мне очень нужна поддержка семьи.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Как же я туда пойду?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Я же тебя сейчас ненавижу!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Дети, а вы пойдёте со мной?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "yulia",
   "t": "Нет, папа, у нас экскурсия.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "yulia",
   "t": "Все старшие классы завтра едут.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Понятно. Значит, никто не поможет.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Ты сам виноват в своих бедах.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's see how Ivan's plea for family loyalty falls completely flat.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Привет, семья! Я вернулся домой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hello, family! I returned home.' Ivan tries to greet everyone cheerfully after disappearing.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Ох, живой! Надо же!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Oh, alive! Well, I never!' Nina's sarcastic exclamation greets his unexpected return.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Тебя три дня дома не было!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You were not home for three days!' Three whole days without a word or a phone call left the family frantic.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Я ночами совсем не спала.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I did not sleep at all at night.' Nina spent night after night wide awake worrying whether he was even alive.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я просто взял короткую паузу.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I simply took a short break.' Ivan offers a weak excuse for his long drinking binge.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Завтра вечером у меня дебаты.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Tomorrow evening I have a debate.' Ivan awkwardly brings up the real reason he came home: the live television debate is tomorrow night.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Мне очень нужна поддержка семьи.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I really need the family's support.' To face the cameras after the scandal, he wants his wife and kids sitting in the studio audience.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Как же я туда пойду?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'How on earth will I go there?' Nina stares at him in disbelief — how could she possibly sit there smiling after what he put them through?",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Я же тебя сейчас ненавижу!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I hate you right now!' Nina bluntly refuses to stand by his side in public.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Дети, а вы пойдёте со мной?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Children, and will you go with me?' Ivan turns to his offspring hoping for loyalty.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "yulia",
   "t": "Нет, папа, у нас экскурсия.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, Dad, we have a field trip.' Yulia immediately provides an excuse to decline.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "yulia",
   "t": "Все старшие классы завтра едут.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'All the upper grades are going tomorrow.' Yulia backs up her excuse by claiming the whole high school is going on the trip.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Понятно. Значит, никто не поможет.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I see. That means no one will help.' Ivan accepts the harsh reality that he is entirely alone.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Ты сам виноват в своих бедах.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You yourself are to blame for your troubles.' Nina delivers the final stinging rebuke. Now listen to Ivan's awkward conversation with his family once more.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Привет, семья! Я вернулся домой.",
   "gap": 0.5
